{"2882560": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "CAMPS", "steam_appid": 2882560, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Camps</strong> is a tactical sandbox focused on player-made, fully destructible playgrounds.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Using an in-game location constructor, players design military bases, compounds, and custom combat environments, then deploy and fight as everything can be destroyed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2882560/extras/0d5c4c0659442e2d8d29d9a90c22ead5.avif?t=1770934174\" width=1280 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create your own combat locations using an embedded location constructor.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design bases, compounds, or experimental layouts.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Locations are not decorative, they become real, playable combat zones.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2882560/extras/b941db5865c8b02f4d597bb69985b776.poster.avif?t=1770934174\" width=568 height=234 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2882560/extras/b941db5865c8b02f4d597bb69985b776.webm?t=1770934174\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2882560/extras/b941db5865c8b02f4d597bb69985b776.mp4?t=1770934174\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>CAMPS provides intuitive and easy-to-use toolsets for creating user generated content (UGC) and distributing it to the Steam Workshop.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2882560/extras/31d3e013bab7d30d2e16b36aea5f44c2.avif?t=1770934174\" width=1280 height=150 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully destructible environments where walls, structures, and cover can collapse.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battles evolve as the terrain changes during combat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No position is permanently safe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2882560/extras/60b34f484ca104bf6e7d6c0a10698be0.poster.avif?t=1770934174\" width=560 height=234 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2882560/extras/60b34f484ca104bf6e7d6c0a10698be0.webm?t=1770934174\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2882560/extras/60b34f484ca104bf6e7d6c0a10698be0.mp4?t=1770934174\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2882560/extras/f693f480bb0069ac765009a028fe6b9e.avif?t=1770934174\" width=1280 height=150 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Procedural map generation ensures every session is different.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Emergent gameplay driven by  adaptable scenarios and missions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> <br>  <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2882560/extras/290f450b86d9e0f12f60af2ac9d2bee0.poster.avif?t=1770934174\" width=560 height=234 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2882560/extras/290f450b86d9e0f12f60af2ac9d2bee0.webm?t=1770934174\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2882560/extras/290f450b86d9e0f12f60af2ac9d2bee0.mp4?t=1770934174\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>    </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2882560/extras/26cb37079895141a84f62d72db393182.avif?t=1770934174\" width=1280 height=150 /></span></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equipment and loot categorized by type and durability.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Risk-reward decisions on every deployment.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gear choices directly affect survival and tactics.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2882560/extras/eeceec8b266c77352ea2ef5c99ae7279.poster.avif?t=1770934174\" width=560 height=234 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2882560/extras/eeceec8b266c77352ea2ef5c99ae7279.webm?t=1770934174\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2882560/extras/eeceec8b266c77352ea2ef5c99ae7279.mp4?t=1770934174\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img cla